      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXII} Se ðeof gefehð, ah X sciƚƚ, ⁊ se cyning ðone ðeof; ⁊ þa mægas him swerian aðas unfæhða.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who catches a thief receives 10 shillings, and the king the thief; and his kinsmen swear oaths to renounce feuding.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">He who captures a thief shall have 10 shillings. The thief shall be given up to the king, and his kinsmen shall swear that they will carry on no vendetta against him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se (þe) ðeof gefehð, he ah X scll', ⁊ se cyning þone ðeof; ⁊ þa magas him swerian aþas unfehþa.</ab>
      </div>
